CHAPTER.VERS:
Don't be

          {+}
         as the horse, or as the mule, which have no understanding; Whose trappings must be bit and bridle to hold them in, [Else] they will not come near to you.

Be glad in Yahweh, and rejoice, you

          {+}
         righteous; And shout for joy, all you

          {+}
         who are upright in heart.
